# Keep the Docker build context small. The upstream source (flexisip,
# flexisip-conference + their submodules) is pre-cloned on the CI runner
# into src-proxy/ and src-conf/ and passed in via COPY. Nothing else is
# needed in the build context except the entrypoint scripts under docker/.
# Whitelist those and exclude everything else.

*
!docker/
!docker/**
!src-proxy/
!src-proxy/**
!src-conf/
!src-conf/**
